** MMP9000 - CONTINUATION FOLD REGRESSION FIXTURE
** Exercises a condition that wraps onto the next physical line *before* the
** connective, i.e. the first line ends in a literal, not AND/OR/etc. See
** issue 4.5 / plan doc Phase 4: this is the "worst failure mode" case --
** the truncated version still looks like a complete, well-formed rule.
DEFINE DATA LOCAL
1 ORDER-VIEW VIEW OF MILL-ORDER
  2 ORDER-NO
  2 CUSTOMER-NO
  2 ORDER-STATUS
1 #FLAG (N1)
END-DEFINE
*
IF ORDER-VIEW.ORDER-STATUS = 'CONF'
  AND ORDER-VIEW.CUSTOMER-NO = 'C00123'
  MOVE 1 TO #FLAG
END-IF
END
